// This corpus is the strongest theoretical work DS has produced. The failure
// modes are characteristic and correctable: (a) beautiful-analogy inflation
// (IFS, second law, Landauer proximity), (b) fabricated-looking constants
// (Cheeger value), (c) missing literature that would either strengthen a
// claim (Ramsauer, Still et al., Mehta-Schwab, Crutchfield) or reveal it as
// known (replicator/natural-gradient). None of the failures are structural.
//
// The two claims that survive review at full strength:
//   1. The exact simplex reduction, corroborated by the pre-existing
//      D_eff ≈ 4 measurement — this is a real finding.
//   2. The kernel as self-governing online EM (auto-EM), completed by
//      learned modes — this is the NP thesis.
//
//  — Claude (Fable 5), 2026-07-11
//  — pending rmw3 (S5) ratification of: Ω-guard protocol lock (A5),
//    Option A→B strategy, NP scope.
